	)
	(text "Type 2 compensation network:\nPM: 60 - 65 degrees from 8V - 24V\nCrossover frequency: 6 - 14.5 kHz\nNeed to check for subharmonic oscillation at 8 - 12V\nSee Calculations/lm5155_comp.xlsx"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 183.896 228.092 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2cd2497c-ba04-4c04-91c2-3f1500e9ab6d")
	)
	(text "30V Boost Converter\nSee design at: \nhttps://webench.ti.com/appinfo/webench/scripts/SDP.cgi?ID=0BA97F1BCA9C3035\n\nf_sw = 747.19kHz\nVout = 29.71V +/- 0.0399V\nI_out(max) = 2A\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 163.322 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.905 1.905)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3e015d83-fac0-4001-b3bf-fa3647a5ff48")
	)
	(text "-3.3V source"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 95.25 93.726 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.905 1.905)
			)
		)
		(uuid "522adaaf-8ec7-49cd-8a10-60ba6ea53c7b")
	)
	(text "+5V Buck Converter\nOptimized for size and for low currents (<1A),\nbut works up to 2.5A\nSwitching frequency: 757 kHz, set by RT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 108.458 75.692 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "53c20334-9da2-4ed3-8cda-925b9ada7df0")
	)
	(text "Charge pump IC. Capacitor values based on TI recommendations"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 97.79 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "62fc6927-777f-43d8-930c-764170c43971")
	)
	(text "TLV75733 Specs:\nIout: 1A\nVout: 3.3V\nMinimum input/output capacitance: 1 uF\nLine regulation: 0.06%\nLoad regulation: 2.1% over 0.1mA - 1A. Since\nthis is a linear relation (Fig 5-13) and the\nanalog circuit uses < 50 mA I am not worried\nabout this impacting analog performance.\nPSRR: ~40 dB @ 700 kHz, C_out=45 uF, Vin=5V\nI am slightly concerned about temeprature\nperformance at low temperatures, however,\nas the temperature will spike when\ntransmitting which could cause fluctuations\nin the output voltage"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 283.21 95.758 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "86684c06-58d7-4f4b-a563-7e41f2eb36df")
	)
	(text "Break-before-make On-Off-On to switch \nbetween USB 5V or the local 5V supply. \nSwitch is rated for 3A which should be\nmore than enough for the 5V rail. This\nreduces the complexity and also removes\nany leakage current from MOSFETS."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 164.592 38.862 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "877be82c-f706-4017-8d48-16c4167ef572")
	)
